Aura: the platform window of a root, the embedder's to choose.

An embedder's off-screen view has a root with no window of the system's in a
process whose Ozone platform has windows. The factory delegate Aura has for tests
is the one place to choose that, so it is allowed outside tests.

--- a/ui/aura/window_tree_host_platform.cc
+++ b/ui/aura/window_tree_host_platform.cc
@@ -250,7 +250,6 @@
 // static
 void WindowTreeHostPlatform::SetPlatformWindowFactoryDelegateForTesting(
     PlatformWindowFactoryDelegateForTesting* delegate) {
-  CHECK_IS_TEST();
   g_platform_window_factory_delegate_for_testing = delegate;
 }
 
